  "description": "A fast INotifyPropertyChanged source generator for .NET. Eliminates MVVM boilerplate with a single [Notify] attribute, no runtime dependency, full IntelliSense, and debuggable generated code.\n\nFeatures:\n• Auto-generates properties with PropertyChanged notifications\n• Built-in equality guards prevent redundant events\n• Partial hooks: On{Property}Changing(oldValue, newValue) and On{Property}Changed()\n• [NotifyAlso] for dependent properties\n• [NotifySetter] for access control (private, protected, internal)\n• INotifyPropertyChanging support for undo/redo scenarios\n• [NotifyCanExecuteChangedFor] for automatic command refresh\n• [NotifySuppressable] for batch notification suppression\n• Nested [Notify] class support with generic declaration preservation\n• Analyzer diagnostics and code fixes for invalid partial declarations\n• Works with WPF, MAUI, Blazor, Avalonia, Uno Platform, WinUI, and Xamarin\n• AOT compatible and trimming safe",
  "developmentDependency": true,
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
