  "releaseNotes": "v1.7.0:\n• Generate C# 14/preview partial properties from [Notify] without a runtime dependency\n• Support [NotifyAlso] on partial properties and reject ambiguous generated names with NOTIFY009\n• Expand transitive [NotifyAlso] dependencies with cycle diagnostics (NOTIFY008)",
